# Enterprise Engineering Standards (.agents Framework)

Read `AGENTS.md` for the full architectural index and consult the specific modular standard in `.agents/rules/` matching your active task:

- **Security (OWASP A01–A10, LLM01–LLM10)**: `.agents/rules/01-security-and-owasp.md`
- **UI/UX & Tactile Human Craft**: `.agents/rules/02-ui-ux-human-craft.md`
- **Clean Architecture & Result Pattern**: `.agents/rules/03-architecture-and-code.md`
- **Database, CQRS, UUIDv7 & Optimistic Lock**: `.agents/rules/04-database-and-cqrs.md`
- **Observability (OTel, AsyncLocalStorage, PII Redaction)**: `.agents/rules/05-observability-otel.md`
- **Testing Strategy (70/20/10 & AAA Pattern)**: `.agents/rules/06-testing-strategy.md`
- **Git & PR Governance (Trunk-Based, Conventional Commits)**: `.agents/rules/07-git-branch-and-pr.md`
- **DevOps & IaC (Distroless, Graceful Shutdown, Terraform)**: `.agents/rules/08-devops-and-iac.md`
- **Frontend Engineering (State Triad, RHF+Zod, Zero CLS)**: `.agents/rules/09-frontend-engineering.md`
- **Monolith vs Microservices (ADR, Outbox, Saga, Circuit Breaker)**: `.agents/rules/10-monolith-vs-microservices.md`
- **Computational Complexity & SLO Metrics (Big-O, CWV, RED, USE, DORA)**: `.agents/rules/11-computational-complexity-and-metrics.md`
- **API Design, OpenAPI Contracts, & Versioning**: `.agents/rules/12-api-design-and-versioning.md`
- **Caching (Jittered TTL), Concurrency Locks, & Rate Limiting**: `.agents/rules/13-caching-and-rate-limiting.md`
- **Data Privacy, PII Redaction, & Immutable Audit Logs**: `.agents/rules/14-data-privacy-and-compliance.md`

## Production Templates (`.agents/templates/`)
Instantiate features from `.agents/templates/` (`use-case-template.ts`, `idempotency-middleware.ts`, `circuit-breaker-client.ts`, `saga-coordinator.ts`, `outbox-worker.ts`, `graceful-shutdown.ts`, `otel-logger.ts`, `frontend-query-form.tsx`, `Dockerfile.distroless`, `terraform-base.tf`, and `harness/*`) and always verify changes with `./.agents/hooks/scripts/harness-verify.sh`.
